{
  "name": "worker_despacho",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a6e7d9f4-f7fc-418f-86a8-9051168430db",
      "name": "Cada minuto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -920,
        180
      ],
      "notes": "paso 2: '...enviando un maximo de 10 mensajes espaciados uniformemente a razon de 1 mensaje por minuto'."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.MILERN_API_BASE }}/api/v1/internal/despacho/siguiente",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.MILERN_INTERNAL_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "3403e7c3-be36-4d82-af30-2805578a4d79",
      "name": "Reclamar esfuerzo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -700,
        180
      ],
      "notes": "El backend aplica las dos restricciones de caudal (10 por UE y 60 s entre mensajes) y toma el item con FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "hay-item",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.item }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "object",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hay-chat",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.item?.chat_id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d49bf205-26eb-47e8-a924-99fc87863b83",
      "name": "Hay esfuerzo para enviar?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -480,
        180
      ],
      "notes": "Rama falsa: cola vacia, limite de ventana alcanzado, espaciado no cumplido u horas de silencio (motivo=\"horas_silencio\"). Sin item no se llama a la API de Telegram."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.item.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.item.contenido }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "id": "0d841f25-5e90-44ac-a7ce-9b70e713e340",
      "name": "Enviar esfuerzo a Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        80
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "BRBShQvaEppiHCtg",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "Contenido del esfuerzo: nodo_esfuerzo para origen 'nodo'; padre + enlace + contenido para origen 'grafo'."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.MILERN_API_BASE }}/api/v1/internal/despacho/{{ $('Reclamar esfuerzo').item.json.item.id }}/confirmar",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.MILERN_INTERNAL_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ telegram_message_id: $json.message_id ?? null }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "970d8596-50db-4ee1-8268-c6ba939193df",
      "name": "Confirmar recepcion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "notes": "paso 2: 'Se actualizan indices futuros y contadores tras cada confirmacion de recepcion de la API de Telegram'. Aqui el backend incrementa conteo_esfuerzo, evalua la transicion de fase (36/84/108) y recalcula indice_siguiente_esfuerzo."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.MILERN_API_BASE }}/api/v1/internal/despacho/{{ $('Reclamar esfuerzo').item.json.item.id }}/fallo",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.MILERN_INTERNAL_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ error: String($json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? 'fallo de envio en Telegram') }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "ce04c278-0dea-4637-bd69-410e23087249",
      "name": "Registrar fallo de envio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "notes": "El item vuelve a 'pendiente' hasta agotar DESPACHO_MAX_INTENTOS; el contador del nodo no se incrementa porque no hubo confirmacion."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "42754aef-0b5b-49e0-8fb5-ac5ebd04b2a0",
      "name": "Sin trabajo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "61b16506-71c0-4bc5-a399-1da55fd4b7c7",
              "name": "item.contenido",
              "value": "={{ $json.item.contenido.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2d20b07a-c2e3-4a89-a392-da89fbda2e5b",
              "name": "item.chat_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.item.chat_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -340,
        -60
      ],
      "id": "6dbb6d41-466c-4ba0-80ab-2b653ee15239",
      "name": "Edit Fields"
    }
  ],
